        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-mw96kyp4-8b4psxk3",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "Our local team may substitute hotels of the same category and rearrange the order of excursions while keeping the itinerary intact."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:note:0c2fe2a500fb40d2",
      "field": "note",
